# LWC configuration files
**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json

# LWC Jest
**/__tests__/**

node_modules/

# ---- Org-specific / PROD-only metadata (excluded for sandbox deploys) ----

# DevOps Center + Dev Hub standard objects (PROD only)
